Data.DatabaseSchemes:
CREATE TABLE Users (
    UserId UUID PRIMARY KEY,
    Email VARCHAR(255) UNIQUE NOT NULL,
    RegistrationDate TIMESTAMP DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP
);

CREATE TABLE PageViews (
    PageViewId UUID PRIMARY KEY,
    UserId UUID REFERENCES Users(UserId),
    PagePath VARCHAR(500) NOT NULL,
    ViewTimestamp TIMESTAMP DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP
);

Storage Technology Summary: A highly available, managed relational database service (e.g., Azure SQL Database, AWS RDS PostgreSQL, GCP Cloud SQL PostgreSQL) with read replicas for scaling read-heavy workloads. Caching layer (e.g., Redis) for frequently accessed static content and user sessions.
